            "text": "Both screen products for substances banned in sport. NSF Certified for Sport also verifies label claims, screens for contaminants and audits facilities, and is common in US leagues and colleges. Informed Sport tests every batch before release and is common in Europe and Olympic sport. Use whichever program your sport or organization recognizes."
