          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The ISSN recommends 1.4 to 2.0 g per kilogram of body weight per day for most exercising people, in servings of about 0.25 g per kilogram, or 20 to 40 g. Strength athletes often target 1.6 to 2.2 g per kilogram, endurance athletes around 1.2 to 1.6 g, and athletes dieting hard may need more."
          }
